{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0000", "block": 0, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 49, "sha256": "92374150ae60c8ac", "text": "Week 8 – Multi-Stack AI-Accelerated Web App Build"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0001", "block": 1, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 21, "sha256": "73f9b402d9caee3d", "text": "Demo Day Confirmation"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0002", "block": 2, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 105, "sha256": "5defe7be6c3d30f6", "text": "Please navigate to this [form](https://forms.gle/J3R3PSRqnFAJxhjG8) for details about our class demo day."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0003", "block": 3, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 19, "sha256": "f37aa9121bd2972e", "text": "Assignment Overview"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0004", "block": 4, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 303, "sha256": "6700d07cb8d69633", "text": "Build the same functional web application in 3 distinct technology stacks. At least one version must be created using [`bolt.new`](https://bolt.new/), an AI app generation platform. At least one version must use a non-JavaScript language for either the frontend or backend (e.g., Django, Ruby on Rails)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0005", "block": 5, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 323, "sha256": "875a3b4f2793d73b", "text": "You may reuse the app from previous weeks (the \"developer control center\") or create a new app of your choosing, as long as it meets the [minimum functional scope](#minimum-functional-scope). The app should be end-to-end functional (frontend + backend + persistence where applicable) and demonstrate a coherent feature set."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0006", "block": 6, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 24, "sha256": "35782a3200039c68", "text": "Minimum Functional Scope"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0007-i00", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 89, "sha256": "b58824d832acbb9a", "text": "User can create, read, update, and delete a primary resource (e.g., notes, tasks, posts)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0007-i01", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 76, "sha256": "d25f3a4e84ef5fd3", "text": "Persistent storage (database or file-based) where appropriate for the stack."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0007-i02", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 36, "sha256": "bbaa0c3a2ead66c5", "text": "Basic validation and error handling."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0007-i03", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 54, "sha256": "4c23078c27cd22cb", "text": "Simple but functional UI that surfaces the main flows."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0007-i04", "block": 7, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 80, "sha256": "4b669a14d2bc23af", "text": "Clear instructions to run each version locally (and deploy links if you deploy)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0008", "block": 8, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 18, "sha256": "187954532f20afab", "text": "Stack Requirements"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0009", "block": 9, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 88, "sha256": "45a5b5aa460f0518", "text": "Build 3 separate versions of the same app, each of which use a distinct stack. Examples:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0010-i00", "block": 10, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 39, "sha256": "e5ae28509287c9ff", "text": "MERN (MongoDB, Express, React, Node.js)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0010-i01", "block": 10, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 40, "sha256": "44abde8640c8726f", "text": "MEVN (MongoDB, Express, Vue.js, Node.js)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0010-i02", "block": 10, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 23, "sha256": "d8e63f1d3d2217fc", "text": "Django + React (or Vue)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0010-i03", "block": 10, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 29, "sha256": "21834f53e688e77a", "text": "Flask + Vanilla JS (or React)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0010-i04", "block": 10, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 26, "sha256": "12d6dea8feca3e3a", "text": "Next.js + Node (or NestJS)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0010-i05", "block": 10, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 26, "sha256": "4980d951f46d984e", "text": "Ruby on Rails (full-stack)"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0011", "block": 11, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 139, "sha256": "07e94158d28216c2", "text": "Reminder that at least one version must include a non-JavaScript language for either frontend or backend (e.g., Python/Django, Ruby/Rails)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0012", "block": 12, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 215, "sha256": "10324fffacc18c13", "text": "At least one version must be built using the AI app generation platform **[`bolt.new`](https://bolt.new/)**, but feel free to explore other app generation platforms (e.g. Lovable, Figma Make) for the other versions."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0013", "block": 13, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 16, "sha256": "2fa24ff6ba87725d", "text": "Learn about Bolt"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0014", "block": 14, "kind": "para", "translate": true, "chars": 365, "sha256": "13399e9ddb2ed247", "text": "Bolt is an AI-assisted development platform that generates websites, web apps, and mobile apps from natural language prompts. Users can describe their idea in plain text, and Bolt produces a functional prototype—ranging from landing pages and e-commerce sites to CRMs and mobile tools—within minutes. Learn more [here](https://support.bolt.new/building/intro-bolt)."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0015", "block": 15, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 24, "sha256": "f026021006222431", "text": "Claim your Bolt Credits:"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0016-i00", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 64, "sha256": "2310bbcad07fdc63", "text": "Locate the unique Bolt promotion code that we've emailed to you."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0016-i01", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 55, "sha256": "c71e3db9b4a12463", "text": "Navigate to [bolt.new](bolt.new) and create an account."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0016-i02", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 108, "sha256": "e2723a9f08063eb6", "text": "In Personal Settings > Subscriptions & Tokens, in the Upgrade to Pro block, click the blue \"Upgrade\" button."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0016-i03", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 81, "sha256": "1ad360d530f04d4e", "text": "Select \"Add promotion code\" and paste your unqiue promotion code into this field."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0016-i04", "block": 16, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 224, "sha256": "dd665df2e3be9404", "text": "You’ll receive 3 months of Bolt Pro for free. A credit card is required to activate the trial. **Remember to cancel before the 3-month period ends to avoid automatic billing if you don’t plan to continue your subscription.**"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0017", "block": 17, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 35, "sha256": "185f0b2be912dad9", "text": "Tips for Usage of AI App Generators"}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0018-i00", "block": 18, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 162, "sha256": "3949bc7b8233c6ec", "text": "App generators like Bolt are best-suited for modern full-stack technologies, which you will get by default when using them without specifying specific frameworks."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0018-i01", "block": 18, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 96, "sha256": "025a1a2d4541704d", "text": "Prefer starting from a clean prompt describing your app concept, entities, routes, and UI flows."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0018-i02", "block": 18, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 63, "sha256": "ebebfed4679daca7", "text": "Clearly describe data models and relationships in your prompts."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0018-i03", "block": 18, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 100, "sha256": "0a6f6cb1c4f49edb", "text": "Iteratively refine prompts for data models, CRUD endpoints, auth (if used), and frontend components."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0018-i04", "block": 18, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 57, "sha256": "8e160769e420eddf", "text": "Keep each version isolated to avoid dependency conflicts."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0018-i05", "block": 18, "kind": "list_item", "translate": true, "chars": 90, "sha256": "28f50033f9e57710", "text": "Export or sync generated code and commit it as a standalone project folder for that stack."}
{"slug": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd", "id": "repo-fall2025-week8-assignmentmd#b0019", "block": 19, "kind": "heading", "translate": true, "chars": 12, "sha256": "c7ec4b92c29ba226", "text": "Deliverables"}
